  "details": "The new main menu no longer locks you in the air if you're falling, this can make it an issue for example if you find yourself in a world where you are free-falling endlessly and are unable to escape without restarting the client. A solution for soft-lock situations such as this without having to restart would be a much welcomed solution.\nVideo: https://files.catbox.moe/2lclm3.mp4\n^ In the video, visually I'm still locked in the air, but in actuality I am still falling. This has also led to some other interesting situations like seen below.\nAddition video: https://files.catbox.moe/1iyt0z.mp4",
